パッパラパッパラパッパララッパッパ
Pappa-para-pappala-ra-pappa,

314
00:33:14,661 --> 00:33:16,531
謎々数えて遊びましょう
let's count and play with riddles.

315
00:33:17,531 --> 00:33:19,041
タッタタラタッタラタッタラタッタ
Tatta-tara-tattara-ra-tatta,

316
00:33:19,911 --> 00:33:22,421
何故何故此処で踊っているのでしょう
why, why are we dancing here?

317
00:33:23,801 --> 00:33:25,231
簡単なことも解らないわ あたしって何だっけ
I don't even understand simple things, what am I again?

318
00:33:27,811 --> 00:33:29,671
それすら夜の手に取り残されて
Even that is caught in the hands of the night,

319
00:33:30,981 --> 00:33:32,541
愛のように消える
fading away like love.

320
00:33:33,771 --> 00:33:35,391
さようならも言えぬまま泣いた
I couldn't even say goodbye and softly cried.

321
00:33:37,541 --> 00:33:39,151
フォニー フォニー フォニー
Phony, phony, phony,

322
00:33:39,591 --> 00:33:41,291
嘘に絡まっている
I am entangled in lies.

323
00:33:41,791 --> 00:33:43,131
あたしはフォニー
I am a phony.

324
00:33:44,651 --> 00:33:45,441
antipathy world

325
00:33:56,931 --> 00:33:59,251
何時しか空の音がいやに鳴り合って
When did the sounds of the sky start ringing annoyingly?

326
00:34:00,131 --> 00:34:02,181
色の目があなたを溶いている
Colored eyes are melting you away.

327
00:34:03,271 --> 00:34:05,041
鏡に映るあたしを欠いて
Losing the me reflected in the mirror,

328
00:34:05,721 --> 00:34:07,771
誰もが見間違った虚像
a false image that everyone misunderstood.

329
00:34:09,161 --> 00:34:11,501
何して愛なんてものに群がり
How do I swarm to things like love,

330
00:34:11,881 --> 00:34:13,481
それを欲して生きるのだ
and live desiring it?

331
00:34:14,421 --> 00:34:16,851
今日も泳いでいる夜の電車が
Today too, the night train I'm swimming in

332
00:34:17,631 --> 00:34:19,511
通り去っていく 踊り明かせよ
is passing by, let's dance the night away!

333
00:34:20,451 --> 00:34:22,111
パッパラパッパラパッパララッパッパ
Pappa-para-pappala-ra-pappa,

334
00:34:23,001 --> 00:34:25,011
謎々騙して歌いましょう
let's trick and sing with riddles.

335
00:34:25,911 --> 00:34:27,471
タッタタラタッタラタッタラタッタ
Tatta-tara-tattara-ra-tatta,

336
00:34:28,231 --> 00:34:30,451
何故何故此処が痛むのでしょう
why, why does it hurt here?

337
00:34:42,552 --> 00:34:44,252
惨々な日々は変わらないわ
These miserable days never change.

338
00:34:47,382 --> 00:34:49,252
絶望の雨はやまないわ
The rain of despair will not stop.

339
00:34:53,532 --> 00:34:55,252
さようならも言えぬまま泣いた
I couldn't even say goodbye and cried.

340
00:34:56,932 --> 00:34:58,602
フォニー フォニー フォニー
Phony, phony, phony,

341
00:34:58,802 --> 00:35:00,112
嘘に絡まっている
I am entangled in lies.

342
00:35:00,216 --> 00:35:01,906
嘘に絡まっている ただ
Trapped in lies, just...

343
00:35:02,156 --> 00:35:05,106
簡単なことも分からないわ あたしって何だっけ
I don't even understand the simplest things. Who am I again?

344
00:35:07,806 --> 00:35:10,206
それすら夜の手にほどかれて
Even that is undone by the hands of the night,

345
00:35:10,206 --> 00:35:13,406
愛のように消える 消える
disappearing like love.

346
00:35:14,156 --> 00:35:16,856
さようならまたねと呟いた フォニイ
I murmured 'goodbye, see you later,' Phony.

347
00:35:18,156 --> 00:35:23,056
嘘に絡まっている あたしはフォニイ
Trapped in lies, I am a phony.

348
00:35:24,156 --> 00:35:29,006
造花だけが知っている 秘密のフォニイ
Only the artificial flowers know this secret phony.

349
00:35:49,106 --> 00:35:53,056
微睡みの淵で目蓋に揺蕩う 夢想の神は優雅に微笑み死を降す
Drifting at the edge of slumber beneath the eyelids, the god of dreams smiles gracefully and brings death.

350
00:35:53,356 --> 00:35:57,056
時空を総べる因果の鎖は絡み出す 神の与えし空想 Program
The chains of causality governing space-time begin to entangle. The fantasy program bestowed by the gods.

351
00:35:57,856 --> 00:36:05,556
さあ eins zwei drei! 重なり合う さあ eins zwei drei! 死を避けて 滅滅の遊戯に焦がれる奇跡を奪う Survivalgame 螺旋のように
Now, eins zwei drei! Overlapping. Now, eins zwei drei! Avoiding death. Stealing the miracle yearned for in the game of destruction, Survivalgame, like a spiral.

352
00:36:06,356 --> 00:36:15,056
泡の未来図書き換えるように 空想繋ぐ輪廻のノイズが鳴り渡る 時間は歪み因果の旋律は崩れ去る 神の与えし継承 Program
As if rewriting the future map of bubbles, the noise of reincarnation connecting fantasies resounds. Time distorts and the melody of causality crumbles. The succession program bestowed by the gods.

353
00:36:15,556 --> 00:36:22,556
さあ eins zwei drei! 連なり合う さあ eins zwei drei! 死を振り切って 滅滅の遊戯に抗う奇跡に挑む Erasergame 夢幻のように
Now, eins zwei drei! Connecting. Now, eins zwei drei! Shaking off death. Challenging the miracle to defy the game of destruction, Erasergame, like a dream.

354
00:36:23,856 --> 00:36:31,056
神の与えし機械 Program さあ eins zwei drei! 重なり合う さあ eins zwei drei! 死を避けて
The mechanical program bestowed by the gods. Now, eins zwei drei! Overlapping. Now, eins zwei drei! Avoiding death.

355
00:36:31,556 --> 00:36:40,056
怜悧なる傍観者 焦がれる生死よりも遠く 最果てにある箱庭で終わりのない奇跡があると信じていた
A shrewd bystander, far beyond the yearning life and death, believing that in the miniature garden at the farthest end, there is an endless miracle.

356
00:36:57,556 --> 00:37:04,556
交わる 線と線 着飾る 大好きなアレコレソレ
Intersecting lines and lines, dressing up with all my favorite things.

357
00:37:04,556 --> 00:37:09,056
そう いつだって 譲れないアイデンティティ
That's right, an identity I can never compromise, always.

358
00:37:09,556 --> 00:37:16,556
手探り 手繰り寄せても 繰返し 絡まるの 気持ちの糸
Even if I grope and pull them close, over and over, the threads of emotion entangle.

359
00:37:16,556 --> 00:37:21,056
ねぇ いつだって 諦めたままのディスタンス
Hey, the distance always left abandoned.

360
00:37:21,056 --> 00:37:27,056
キリのない 振り出しでも 繋いでたいなら 外さない 秘め事
Even from an endless starting point, if I want to stay connected, I won't let go of this secret.

361
00:37:27,056 --> 00:37:32,056
惹かれ 逢って 存在 綴る セカイ 共鳴させたなら
Attracted and meeting, if we made this world that spells our existence resonate,

362
00:37:32,056 --> 00:37:41,056
ねぇ このままで ままで いられるかな 淡い期待に通せんぼ 塞いで曖昧 知らん顔 こうやって繋いでいられたなら
Hey, can we stay just like this? Blocked by faint expectations, plugging ears with vague ignorance. If we could stay connected like this,

363
00:37:53,056 --> 00:37:56,556
痛い痛いのとちだ
It hurts, it hurts...

364
00:38:06,556 --> 00:38:11,056
やめよよ やめよよ 傷つくのはもういやだ
Stop it, stop it, I don't want to get hurt anymore.

365
00:38:11,056 --> 00:38:15,556
大丈夫 大丈夫 きっとすべてうまくいくよ
It's alright, it's alright, everything will surely work out fine.

366
00:38:16,056 --> 00:38:20,556
やめよよ やめよよ 傷つくのはもういやだ
Stop it, stop it, I don't want to get hurt anymore.

367
00:38:20,556 --> 00:38:25,056
ああ 意味もなく囁く
Ah, whispering for no reason.

368
00:38:26,056 --> 00:38:30,056
この心揺さぶる ボール
The ball that shakes this heart.

369
00:38:30,056 --> 00:38:39,556
私の心の中で 天使と悪魔が言う どちらに付くかはあなた次第だ
Inside my heart, an angel and a devil whisper; which side you take is entirely up to you.

370
00:38:40,056 --> 00:38:45,556
狂いえないように 生粋迷いなさい
So that you won't go mad, get thoroughly lost.

371
00:38:46,056 --> 00:38:49,056
目を閉じて 両耳塞いだ
I closed my eyes and plugged both ears.

372
00:38:52,556 --> 00:39:01,056
私の心の中で 天使と悪魔が言う どちらの正体も自分自身だ
Inside my heart, an angel and a devil say—both of their true identities are yourself.

373
00:39:01,056 --> 00:39:08,056
天国も地獄も 木の向くまま進め その場所で自分らしくいられるかどうか
Whether heaven or hell, keep moving as your heart desires. Can you truly be yourself in that place?

374
00:39:13,556 --> 00:39:18,556
自分らしく笑えるかどうか
Can you smile as your true self?

375
00:40:30,044 --> 00:40:35,564
のびた人陰を 歩道にならべ
Lining up our elongated shadows on the pavement

376
00:40:36,284 --> 00:40:42,404
夕闇のなかを 君と歩いている
Walking with you through the twilight,

377
00:40:43,164 --> 00:40:49,014
手をつないで いつまでもずっと
Holding hands forever and ever,

378
00:40:49,864 --> 00:40:56,864
そばにいれたなら 泣けちゃうくらい
So close to you it makes me want to cry,

379
00:40:57,864 --> 00:41:04,564
風が冷たくなって 冬の匂いがした
The wind grew colder, and it smelled of winter.

380
00:41:04,564 --> 00:41:10,864
そろそろこの街に 君と近付ける
Soon, the season to get closer to you in this town

381
00:41:10,864 --> 00:41:13,064
季節がくる
will arrive.

382
00:41:25,164 --> 00:41:30,264
今年、最初の雪の華を
This year's very first snow flower,

383
00:41:30,964 --> 00:41:37,564
ふたり寄り添って 眺めているこの時間に
As we snuggle up and gaze at it together,

384
00:41:37,864 --> 00:41:41,864
幸せがあふれだす
happiness overflows.

385
00:41:42,264 --> 00:41:49,964
甘えとか弱さじゃない ただ、キミを愛してる
It's not weakness or dependency, I just love you.

386
00:41:50,164 --> 00:41:57,864
心からそう思った
I thought that from the bottom of my heart.

387
00:42:08,164 --> 00:42:14,964
キミがいると どんなことでも
With you here, no matter what happens,

388
00:42:15,164 --> 00:42:21,564
乗り切れるような 気持ちになってる
I feel like I can get through anything.

389
00:42:21,864 --> 00:42:29,564
こんな日々が いつまでもきっと
Surely, days like these will continue

390
00:42:29,764 --> 00:42:35,564
続いてくことを 祈っているよ
forever and ever, I pray.

391
00:42:36,564 --> 00:42:42,564
風が窓を揺らし 夜は揺り起こして
The wind shakes the window, waking the night,

392
00:42:43,164 --> 00:42:50,064
どんな悲しいことも ボクが笑顔へと変えてあげる
Any sadness, I will turn into a smile for you.

393
00:43:03,164 --> 00:43:07,864
舞い落ちてきた雪の華が
The snow flowers falling around us

394
00:43:08,564 --> 00:43:15,564
窓の外ずっと 降りやむことを知らずに
outside the window, without stopping,

395
00:43:15,864 --> 00:43:19,564
ボクラの街を染める
paint our town.

396
00:43:20,164 --> 00:43:28,064
誰かのために何かをしたいと思えるのが
Knowing that wanting to do something for someone

397
00:43:28,064 --> 00:43:34,064
愛ということを知った
is what love truly means.

398
00:43:41,164 --> 00:43:46,064
もしキミを失ったとしたなら
If I were to lose you,

399
00:43:46,064 --> 00:43:49,064
星になってキミを照らすだろう
I'd become a star to shine on you.

400
00:43:51,164 --> 00:43:55,564
笑顔も涙に濡れてる夜も いつもいつでもそばにいるよ
Even on nights soaked in tears, I'll always be by your side.

401
00:44:06,564 --> 00:44:11,864
今年、最初の雪の華を ふたり寄り添って
This year's very first snow flower, snuggled up together,

402
00:44:16,164 --> 00:44:21,864
眺めているこの時間に 幸せがあふれだす
As we gaze at it, happiness overflows.

403
00:44:23,164 --> 00:44:31,564
甘えとか弱さじゃない ただ、キミとずっと このままで一緒にいたい
It's not weakness or dependency, I just want to stay like this with you forever.

404
00:44:36,564 --> 00:44:44,564
素直にそう思える この街に降り積もってく 真っ白な雪の華
I honestly feel that way. Pure white snow flowers piling up on this town,

405
00:44:49,864 --> 00:44:59,064
ふたりの胸にそっと 想い出を描くよ これからもキミと
Gently sketching memories in our hearts, from now on with you...

406
00:45:40,054 --> 00:45:43,394
And that was "Yuki no Hana". Did you guys like the ballad

407
00:45:43,394 --> 00:45:46,824
and the gondola riding all the way here?

408
00:45:46,974 --> 00:45:54,144
It was a pretty flower, uh, flower snowflake, yes, that I rode on all the way here.

409
00:45:54,284 --> 00:45:58,034
And did you guys like the guest part? Yeah!

410
00:45:58,274 --> 00:46:04,824
I sang a lot of songs with the guests and a full-on medley that I put a lot of thought into.

411
00:46:05,184 --> 00:46:12,374
I really want to talk more about the medley and the concept, but I think I won't have enough time for that.

412
00:46:12,374 --> 00:46:16,784
Maybe I'll talk about that in a future stream. So...

413
00:46:16,994 --> 00:46:21,434
And also thank you so much for my lovely guests for singing with me.
And also, thank you so much to my lovely guests for singing with me.

414
00:46:21,644 --> 00:46:26,614
But there's still one more guest song! Yeah! And that's not the last song by the way, so...

415
00:46:26,774 --> 00:46:32,024
no worries. There's going to be one more guest song that you guys are absolutely gonna love!

416
00:46:32,024 --> 00:46:40,424
And, um, also, also, there's going to be one super exciting announcement that I've been waiting... super waiting to, uh, show you guys.
And, um, also, there's going to be one super exciting announcement that I've been waiting... super waiting to, uh, show you guys.

417
00:46:40,424 --> 00:46:44,224
So please do look forward to that as well.

418
00:46:44,274 --> 00:46:50,774
それと、えっと、雪の花とゲストパートどうでしたか? えー、あの、メドレーとかね、すごく、とても、あの、もう色々考えた上で企画したんで、
And um, how were Yuki no Hana and the guest parts? Um, for the medley, I planned it very, very carefully,

419
00:46:50,774 --> 00:47:00,674
もう本当にね、いろいろ、自分の考えたこともう全部言いたいんですけど、ちょっとそこまで時間ないので、えっと、とにかくね、みんな気に入っていただけるととても嬉しいです。
and I really want to say everything I thought about, but there's not enough time for that. Anyway, I'd be so happy if you all liked it.

420
00:47:00,674 --> 00:47:06,674
そしてね、あの素敵な先輩方と一绪に歌えてとっても嬉しかったです。本当にありがとうございました、先輩方!
And I was so happy to sing together with such wonderful senpais. Thank you so much, senpais!

421
00:47:06,674 --> 00:47:15,574
そして、えっと、まだね、えっとゲストパート、えっとゲスト曲、まだ一曲あるんで、これから歌いますんでね、みんな最後まで見てください。
And um, there's still one more guest song, so we're going to sing it now. Everyone, please watch until the end!

422
00:47:15,574 --> 00:47:25,574
あとね、あの、そのすぐあとにね、あの、もう一つとても素敵で嬉しい、ずっと待ち遠しかった告知と、お披露目があるので、みんな最後まで見てくださいね!
And also, right after that, there's another very wonderful, happy announcement and reveal I've been waiting for, so everyone please watch until the end!

423
00:47:25,574 --> 00:47:30,974
では次の曲行きます。Please listen to the next song!
Now, let's go to the next song. Please listen to the next song!

424
00:48:03,382 --> 00:48:08,372
運命の女神様が目を閉じた
The goddess of fate closed her eyes,

425
00:48:08,472 --> 00:48:13,572
「なんて可愛い赤ん坊なんだこと。
"What an adorable baby she is.

426
00:48:14,072 --> 00:48:19,072
そうだわ!あの子に魔法をかけて遊びましょう」
That's it! Let's cast a spell on her and play."

427
00:48:19,372 --> 00:48:25,072
くぼんだ両目 痩せぎすな身体
Sunken eyes and a gaunt body—

428
00:48:25,072 --> 00:48:30,072
私を見れば誰もが言うのです
whenever anyone looks at me, they say,

429
00:48:30,072 --> 00:48:35,572
「化け物!お前は同じ人間じゃないんだよ」と
"Monster! You're not even human like the rest of us."

430
00:48:35,572 --> 00:48:41,072
悲しいなんて思わない だって
I don't think it's sad, because

431
00:48:41,072 --> 00:48:46,572
思えばほら また涙があふれてくるわ
whenever I think about it, see, tears overflow once more.

432
00:48:46,872 --> 00:48:50,072
もしもし願いが一つ叶うなら
If even a single wish could come true,

433
00:48:50,072 --> 00:48:54,072
世界でたった一人だけの友達を
I'd want just one single friend in all the world.

434
00:48:54,572 --> 00:48:59,072
生きることは素晴らしいこと
Living is a wonderful thing—

435
00:48:59,072 --> 00:49:03,572
そんな風に私も思ってみたい
I want to feel that way about life, too.

436
00:49:03,972 --> 00:49:07,072
「鼠はどうして嫌われるのでしょう?」
"Why are mice so hated?"

437
00:49:07,072 --> 00:49:10,572
彼らは笑って「汚いからだろう」
They laugh and say, "Because they're dirty."

438
00:49:10,572 --> 00:49:15,072
「それなら答えて、目の見えない僕のために
"Then answer me this, for my sightless eyes:

439
00:49:15,072 --> 00:49:20,072
見てみぬふりに理不尽な差別
Turning a blind eye to unreasonable discrimination—

440
00:49:20,072 --> 00:49:25,072
それって鼠とどっちが汚い?」
which of the two is dirtier than a rat?"

441
00:49:25,372 --> 00:49:29,072
後退る彼らに続けて言うんだ
Continuing as they back away, I say,

442
00:49:29,072 --> 00:49:32,072
「二度とするな!」
"Don't ever do that again!"

443
00:49:33,272 --> 00:49:37,072
嬉しいのになぜでしょう かって
Even though I'm happy, why is it

444
00:49:37,072 --> 00:49:42,072
涙がほら やっぱりあふれてくるの
that tears, see, still overflow from my eyes?

445
00:49:42,572 --> 00:49:47,072
もしものなりたいものになれるなら
If I could become whatever I wished,

446
00:49:47,072 --> 00:49:52,072
あなたのの前では普通の女の子に
I'd want to be a normal girl before you.

447
00:49:52,072 --> 00:49:59,572
思うほどに胸が苦しい どうして私たちは私なのですか
Thinking of it hurts my chest so much. Why am I who I am?

448
00:50:00,450 --> 00:50:05,200
ねずみはなんで嫌われるのでしょう
Why are rats so hated?

449
00:50:06,420 --> 00:50:10,660
彼らは笑って「汚いからだろう」
They laugh and say, "Because they're filthy."

450
00:50:11,240 --> 00:50:18,180
それなら答えて 目の見えない僕のために
If that's so, answer this, for my sightless self—

451
00:50:22,500 --> 00:50:27,840
見て見ぬふりに理不尽な差別
Turning a blind eye to unreasonable discrimination,

452
00:50:28,260 --> 00:50:31,060
それってねずみとどっちが汚い？
between that and a rat, which is filthier?

453
00:50:33,500 --> 00:50:39,200
後退る彼らに続けて言うんだ「二度とするな！」
Stepping back, I tell them, "Never do that again!"

454
00:50:45,460 --> 00:50:48,600
嬉しいのになぜでしょう
Why do I feel so happy?

455
00:50:49,780 --> 00:50:58,820
だって 涙が ほら やっぱり あふれてくるのです
Because the tears, look, are overflowing after all.

